--[[
  UnboxingGap v2.0.0 - read-only data measurer for Delta (mobile or desktop). Plain Lua syntax (no +=, continue, //).
  You just play. It records on its own: menus when they open, every wallet/currency change, which game button you tapped (with the open menu and
  area), boxes near you (type, HP bar, break time, reward window), the map around you every time you move far (with rotation) and the world boards.
  Window: status, what menus are still missing, EXPORTAR and PAUSAR. Autosave every 60 s.
  It NEVER reads or stores asset ids (Image, MeshId, TextureId, SoundId, AnimationId), never reads script source, never calls a RemoteEvent/RemoteFunction,
  never buys, attacks, hatches or rebirths for you, and never modifies game objects.
  Output: workspace/UnboxingGap/<session>/*.json (read back and compared). Without writefile: UBG| lines in the console.
]]

